# {{ repo_name }} (multi_repo service set)

{{ services | length }} microservices generated as **independent repositories**
(`topology: multi_repo`, D-005 / D-036). Each subdirectory is a standalone repo:
its own `.copier-answers.yml`, `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `Dockerfile`, and
`docker-compose.yml`. Move each into its own remote when you are ready.

