## Inter-service transport

{% if transport_grpc and transport_rabbitmq -%}
gRPC and RabbitMQ are both wired. Peer endpoints are configured per service via
`APP_PEER_<NAME>_URL` env vars (defaults point at the peer slug).
{%- elif transport_grpc -%}
gRPC is wired. Peer endpoints via `APP_PEER_<NAME>_URL` (default: the peer slug).
{%- elif transport_rabbitmq -%}
RabbitMQ is wired through a shared broker each repo connects to
(`APP_RABBITMQ_URL`).
{%- else -%}
No inter-service transport selected yet.
{%- endif %}

{% if tests_contract -%}
## Proto contract

Each repo carries an identical copy of `proto/`. The contract job checks the
shared definitions stay backward compatible across the set.
{%- endif %}

## Update from the template

```bash
msvc-gen update --output .
```

Re-runs `copier update` in every service repo and re-renders this manifest.

